  "note": "This is Jackson County's 2026 appropriation ordinance (No. 2025-21), passed December 22, 2025 and filed with the state. It sets the most each office and fund may spend; it does not split them into categories. The Solid Waste Revenue Fund sends $981,390 to the Solid Waste Operation and Maintenance Fund, so those dollars appear in both funds."
 },
